  "details": "So, i've waited for more than 2 hours in a queu line to enter a vrchat world to join an event. So it's like 17/20, then 8/20  and then finally when it's 1/20 and it's my time to enter the world it says. YOUR QUEU LINE TOKEN HAS EXPIRED!!! Then i get booted from the queue line and i'm back 20/20 in line. This is already the second time it has happend. It leaves me super depressed because i can't visit my friends in this way. A QUEUE line token should NEVER expire because the waiting lines can take HOURS!!! And then i have to wait another 2 hours only to get booted again, this system doesn't work seriously, so sorry but i want to complain about it.",
